{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3508320/extras/crumps_title.png?t=1743660913\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Crumps</strong> is a small, social, multiplayer, platforming game where you are a <strong>Crump</strong>! <strong>:3</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>SOMEWHAT SOCIAL SANDBOX!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Run around and do whatever! Currently there is mostly just platforming but there is more to come!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>CHARACTER CUSTOMIZATION!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Customize your own <strong>Crump</strong>! Tons of customization options brought to you by our very own <strong>NAE!</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>PLAY WITH FRIENDS!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Full <strong>Multiplayer</strong> with <strong>Hosting</strong> and <strong>Joining</strong> games! Play with your friends or make new ones in game!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>PHYSICS BASED CHARACTERS!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Crump's will react to physics and other Crumps! Crumps can flail around, get launched, slide down things, and more!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3508320?t=1743660913","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3508320/1b264ddab9da78ee0b113dba03e3ea920fa61ffa/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1743660913","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3508320/625bba1cfc29670d5fd2a353a6296958bdda566f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1743660913","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3508320/625bba1cfc29670d5fd2a353a6296958bdda566f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1743660913","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description"